# Default design system

This repository is primarily used for product and experience design work around **理赔向导 / 医疗费用快捷报销**.

For every UI, UX, product-design, interaction-design, visual-design, frontend, mobile, mini-program, H5, prototype, or Figma request:

1. Automatically load `.cursor/skills/alipay-app-design-system/SKILL.md` (visual tokens, components, spacing).
2. Automatically load `.cursor/skills/claims-guide-flow/SKILL.md` (scenarios, page templates, materials diagnosis, registration dual-fallback, edit discipline).
3. Apply semantic tokens, typography, spacing, radius, layout, component-selection, state, copywriting, and QA rules from the Alipay skill.
4. Apply flow map, demo-first content rules, and page patterns from the claims-guide skill when the work touches this product — including vague Figma-link-only requests on file `DLepVQbX1Ll21Y2fh1kmyU`.
5. Use the source Figma component keys before creating replacement primitives.
6. Do not wait for the user to mention 支付宝、理赔向导、设计规范, or the skill names.

This rule also applies to vague requests such as:

- 帮我出设计稿
- 把后续流程做完
- 重新改下这个页面
- 这个稿子不好看
- 帮我优化体验
- 按 demo / 按我发的图改

Only bypass the defaults when the user explicitly names a different design system or explicitly asks not to use these specifications.

Priority order:

1. Explicit user requirements
2. Pasted demo / product screenshots (content truth)
3. Business and compliance constraints
4. `claims-guide-flow` scenario and page rules
5. Alipay APP design-system rules
6. General UI inspiration

Never replace the design system with generic AI styling, even when another design-oriented skill is also loaded.
